- Gap check: https://allgreatthings-44087732.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MFS/pages/65786/Repo+vs+hub+gap+check
- Skill: `agt-docs-hub` (`~/.cursor/skills/agt-docs-hub/SKILL.md`)

When running or improving SEO research / DataForSEO / the monthly loop / CMS draft publish: fetch Confluence, then run the **gap check** (skill `agt-docs-hub` / page `65786`). Print at-bar / behind / ahead. If behind, improve this repo’s runner or defaults this sitting. If ahead on a shared gate, update Confluence. Do not fork playbooks into local docs.

Local leftovers that stay in this repo: WordPress commands/paths, `client.config.json`, brand doctrine (`workspace/brand_truth/`), hub slug `hogeye-cameras`, evidence packs, and dated monthly folders. Not a second copy of the coverage table, $10-tier bar, or Approved-≠-live / create-only CMS rules.
